<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CVRD cut to hold.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CVRD cut to hold.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said it had cut its rating for Brazilian mining giant Companhia Vale do Rio Doce to hold from buy.</p>
<p>-- In a March 5 analysis, the firm said because the minimum price of 10.36 billion reais set Wednesday for the company's privatization &quot;was within the minimum range of our expectations, we are downgrading our recommendation to a hold.&quot;</p>
<p>-- The company's preferred shares were down 0.60 real to 26.50 reais in Sao Paulo.</p>
<p>((--Ian Simpson, Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1879))</p>
